{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic turn-based RPG\u2026 until the game starts noticing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your moves, watch the effects pop. You don\u2019t win by grinding. You win by <strong>not screwing up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.poster.avif?t=1774331677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.webm?t=1774331677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.mp4?t=1774331677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Party with Personality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t play alone. You fight with a team. Five party members. Five personalities. Smart, sarcastic dialogues that break the fourth wall (and your confidence).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/b71d6cb5e65cf2d87adbc046d1401ab1.avif?t=1774331677\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't touch everything you can.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A moral system that reacts to you, not your stats. Steal? cheat? the game remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/f622bf96f54021c3cc894d9295c9aebe.avif?t=1774331677\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Perspectives, One World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world doesn\u2019t always look the way it should. And sometimes, that\u2019s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/f16d9b9a5d328fc5e098a7c1d429741e.avif?t=1774331677\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Friendly Warning (Seriously)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO NOT</strong> try to 100% this game.<br>Some achievements just exist to troll you and test how stubborn you are. They are not balanced. They are not reasonable. And <strong>normal humans are not meant to get them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was lovingly inspired by <i>Epic Battle Fantasy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, these are old memories retold from our perspective.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064560?t=1774331677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064560?t=1774331677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/eb3c038d0efad092ed03702d2af2333296435f17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774331677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/eb3c038d0efad092ed03702d2af2333296435f17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774331677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4151080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic turn-based RPG\u2026 until the game starts noticing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your moves, watch the effects pop. You don\u2019t win by grinding. You win by <strong>not screwing up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.poster.avif?t=1774331677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.webm?t=1774331677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.mp4?t=1774331677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Party with Personality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t play alone. You fight with a team. Five party members. Five personalities. Smart, sarcastic dialogues that break the fourth wall (and your confidence).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/b71d6cb5e65cf2d87adbc046d1401ab1.avif?t=1774331677\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't touch everything you can.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A moral system that reacts to you, not your stats. Steal? cheat? the game remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/f622bf96f54021c3cc894d9295c9aebe.avif?t=1774331677\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Perspectives, One World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world doesn\u2019t always look the way it should. And sometimes, that\u2019s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/f16d9b9a5d328fc5e098a7c1d429741e.avif?t=1774331677\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Friendly Warning (Seriously)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO NOT</strong> try to 100% this game.<br>Some achievements just exist to troll you and test how stubborn you are. They are not balanced. They are not reasonable. And <strong>normal humans are not meant to get them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was lovingly inspired by <i>Epic Battle Fantasy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, these are old memories retold from our perspective.</p>","developers":["Novasypher"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/dd3fb7bde9dc37cf69b646469dfd9097a7dc3f87/header.jpg?t=1774331677","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4064560/494879159/110cc1d5a1fc176ad0f75dddd4ed5ed1e3674c5b/1774329619/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774331676","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4064560/494879159/110cc1d5a1fc176ad0f75dddd4ed5ed1e3674c5b/1774329619/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774331676","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4064560/494879159/110cc1d5a1fc176ad0f75dddd4ed5ed1e3674c5b/1774329619/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774331676","id":257308179,"name":"limitbrea